  "log": [
    {
      "choice": "Black hoodie, black neck gaiter pulled up to the eyes, the Eagles cap Pop gave you turned backward. Nobody looks twice at a kid in a hoodie in Philly.",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "scene": "cold_open",
      "t": 1791897866816
    },
    {
      "choice": "\"Not going home either, huh?\"",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "scene": "a1_saturday",
      "t": 1791897956434
    },
    {
      "choice": "The fourth floor of Charles Library has air conditioning and a beanbag. Sleep.",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "hub": true,
      "scene": "a1_hub",
      "t": 1791898008520
    },
    {
      "choice": "Take the train down to Mifflin Street. Nonna said \"come Sunday\" ten days ago, and you never went. You can't put it off again.",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "hub": true,
      "scene": "a1_hub",
      "t": 1791898013269
    },
    {
      "choice": "Say nothing. Hold her hand. She already knows.",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "scene": "a1_nonna",
      "t": 1791898040483
    },
    {
      "choice": "Go. Take the pizza. Whatever this is, Teddy said please.",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "scene": "a1_order",
      "t": 1791898080400
    },
    {
      "choice": "Sit. Listen. \"Why am I here, Teddy?\"",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "scene": "a2_port_richmond",
      "t": 1791898107298
    },
    {
      "choice": "Tell him what you know: the name Brannigan, the beds, the RA bounty. Everything Halcyon.",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "scene": "a2_pr_why",
      "t": 1791898140520
    },
    {
      "choice": "\"After you, Your Highness.\" You're never going to stop.",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "scene": "a2_blackout",
      "t": 1791898225425
    },
    {
      "choice": "Make her laugh. That's what you're for.",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "roll": {
        "dice": [
          1,
          4
        ],
        "kind": "move",
        "label": "Make her laugh",
        "nudged": false,
        "rewound": false,
        "tier": "weak"
      },
      "scene": "a2_roof",
      "t": 1791898244124
    },
    {
      "choice": "\"I have to go. I can't tell you why. I'm sorry.\" Look at her when you say it.",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "scene": "a2_glow",
      "t": 1791898283964
    },
    {
      "choice": "The window. The woman, the baby, the boy. Get them out.",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "scene": "a3_go",
      "t": 1791898309908
    },
    {
      "choice": "Don't climb. Think. Find another way down. The house next door. The roof.",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "roll": {
        "dice": [
          11
        ],
        "kind": "d20",
        "label": "See the way out",
        "nudged": false,
        "rewound": false,
        "tier": "success"
      },
      "scene": "a3_family",
      "t": 1791898318509
    },
    {
      "choice": "\"There was a fire. I went to help.\" The truth, or most of it. No more than that.",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "scene": "a4_return",
      "t": 1791898388792
    },
    {
      "choice": "\"I keep the closet door closed. Every night. Since I was a kid. Mikey told me there was a guy in there.\" Give her one of yours.",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "scene": "a4_talk_light",
      "t": 1791898447927
    },
    {
      "choice": "Carmen Torres. The bus. \"I was too slow. A grandmother broke her hip because I was half a second too slow.\"",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "scene": "a4_talk_him",
      "t": 1791898483708
    },
    {
      "choice": "\"That sounds lonely.\"",
      "ep": "s01e03",
      "roll": {
        "dice": [
          3,
          6
        ],
        "kind": "move",
        "label": "Hear her",
        "nudged": false,
